                          'Caller tables and operational cap/path/derivation literals remain None; no authority from this author snapshot.',
                          'ctypes/DLL identities, actual Windows command-line parsing, PS canonical JSON parity and byte transport require independent physical proof.',
                          'Retained .NET process owns the venv launcher only; its base-Python child is not proven dead by direct Kill.',
